      <section class="section" id="hva-each" aria-labelledby="hva-each-title">
        <h2 id="hva-each-title">Recommender by recommender</h2>
        <p class="intro">
          The groups are not uniform. The doctor is trusted most and the layperson about as little as the AI tools. The gap is
          widest against the doctor and the nurse, and nearly closes against the layperson. The four AI tools are close to one
          another.
        </p>
        <h3 class="fig-title" id="fig-hva-profile">Figure 11. Each recommender on all three ratings</h3>
        <DotPanels
          items={profileItems}
          panels={profilePanels}
          ariaLabel="Average trust, quantitative reasoning and intuition for each of the eleven recommenders, grouped as human, human with AI, and AI"
          tableLabel="Recommender"
          valueLabel="Average"
        />
        <p class="small muted note">Dots are averages and bars are 95% confidence intervals. Blue is human, marigold is AI, grey is a doctor using AI.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="section" id="hva-link" aria-labelledby="hva-link-title">
        <h2 id="hva-link-title">Do people who trust humans also trust AI?</h2>
